{
  "comment": [
    "Pinned opam universe for bazel/ocaml. Maintained by update_lock.py; the",
    "url/sha256 pins mirror each package's opam-repository metadata (the same",
    "artifact `opam install` would fetch). Fields:",
    "  repo:      the @<repo> Bazel repository name",
    "  src_dirs:  dune directories dune2bazel translates (ignored if override)",
    "  override:  hand-written BUILD in opam/overrides/<name>/BUILD.tpl, used",
    "             when the package's dune tree needs codegen or compiler",
    "             introspection the translator does not model",
    "  libs:      findlib name -> target name within the repo; composes the",
    "             lib_map dune2bazel uses to resolve (libraries ...) entries",
    "  type:      archive type for download_and_extract (default tar.bz2)"
  ],
